  "content": "[Intro]\n[Am]\n\n[Verse 1]\n[Am]From the dusty me-\n[E]sa Her\n[Dm]looming shadow grows\n[Am]\nHidden in the bran-\n[E]ches of the poi-\n[Dm]son creosote\n[Am]\nShe twines\n\n[Chorus]\n[C]her spines up slow-\nly Towards\n[G]the boiling sun\nAnd\n[Dm]when I touched her skin\nMy\n[F]fingers ran with blood\n[Am]\n\n[Bridge]\n[Am]\n\n[Verse 2]\n[Am]In the hushing dusk\n[E]under a\n[Dm]swollen silver moon\n[Am]\nI came walking\n[E]with the wind to\n[Dm]watch the cactus bloom\n[Am]\nAnd\n\n[Chorus]\n[C]strange hands hal-\nted me, the\n[G]looming shadows danced\nI\n[Dm]fell down to the thor-\nny brush and\n[F]felt the trembling hands\n[Am]\n\n[Bridge]\n[Am]\n\n[Verse 3]\n[Am]When the last light\n[E]warms the rocks And\n[Dm]the rattlesnakes un-\n[Am]fold\nMountain cats will come\n[E]to\n[Dm]drag away your bones\n[Am]\nAnd\n\n[Chorus]\n[C]rise with me fore-\nver Ac-\n[G]ross the silent sand\nAnd the\n[Dm]stars will be your eyes\nAnd the\n[F]wind will be my hands\n\n[Outro]\n[Am]",
